SUMMARY:Language Exchange & Social Event @ Madison by Toronto Babel + Lati
 n Music
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\nToron
 to Babel \\| Language Exchange & Social Event @ Madison Ave Pub\n\nWe’re
  back on Wednesday\, April 29 for another night of good conversations\, ne
 w connections\, games & music. Whether you’re practicing a new language 
 or just looking to meet new friends from all over the world\, this is the 
 place to be!\n\nPlus special guest DJ on the decks! DJ FLŸ will be spinni
 ng Salsa\, Reggaetón\, and Latin Classics all night long in the 2nd room 
 🔥🎶 Bring your dance shoes!\n\n🌍 Toronto Babel Social\n✅ Languag
 e Exchange 🇫🇷🇯🇵🇲🇽🇩🇪🇰🇷\n✅ Make New Friends 
 🗣️\n✅ Arts & Crafts Table 🎨\n✅ Fun Board Games 🎲\n✅ DJ Mu
 sic with DJ FLŸ 💃🕺\n\n📍 Madison Avenue Pub – Toronto\n14 Madis
 on Ave\, Toronto\, ON M5R 2S1\n\n🗓️ Wednesday\, April 29\n🕖 7:00 P
 M – 11:00 PM\n\nPull up solo or bring a friend—either way\, you’ll l
 eave with new connections\, good laughs\, and even better vibes 💬🫶
 🌟\n\n💵 $5 Entry Donation\nYour contribution helps cover meetup costs
 \, name tags\, games\, and all the little extras that make the night speci
 al ✨\n\n📲 E-transfer also available:\ntmg8@wealthsimple.me\n\n🔗 Me
 etup:\nhttp://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel\n\n📘 Facebook:\nhttps://www.f
 acebook.com/groups/torontobabel\n\n💬 WhatsApp:\nhttps://chat.whatsapp.c
 om/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7\n\n👉 Check out the calendar & RSVP:\nhttp://w
 ww.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/[#calendar](https://www.instagram.com/explore/t
 ags/calendar/)\n\n📝 Note: Toronto Babel is a welcoming and safe space f
 or all attendees. Any form of harassment or inappropriate behavior will no
 t be tolerated. If you experience or witness any issues\, please inform on
 e of the organizers immediately so we can address it appropriately.\n\n[#L
 anguageExchange](https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/languageexchange/)
  [#MadisonPub](https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/madisonpub/) [#Toron
 toEvents](https://www.instagram.com/explore/tags/torontoevents/) #LearnEng
 lish
